@startuml
title F04 - Configurable morning routine
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #2877B5
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #17324D
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F4F7FA
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF1BF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9C6500
autonumber
actor "Primary caregiver" as Caregiver
boundary "A03\nApp routines" as A03
control "B06\nFleet/config" as B06
control "H07\nHub lifecycle/config" as H07
control "H03\nHub time" as H03
control "H05\nHub rules adapter" as H05
control "S02\nDeterministic rules core" as S02
Caregiver -> A03: Set start, end, grace, required locations and mode
A03 -> S02: Validate deterministic routine/window semantics
A03 -> B06: Publish next desired configuration version
B06 -> H07: Deliver desired HomeConfig
H07 -> H07: Validate and atomically replace active snapshot
H07 -> H03: Apply timezone and trusted boundary parameters
H07 -> H05: Start routine using stable window ID
H05 -> S02: Initialize deterministic RoutineState
H07 -> B06: Report applied version; desired and applied remain distinct
B06 --> A03: Return pending/applied/conflict status
note over Caregiver,S02: Outcome - A versioned routine is validated, atomically applied and visible as desired versus applied state.
@enduml
